<P style="LINE-HEIGHT: 22pt; TEXT-INDENT: 24pt; MARGIN: 0pt auto; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000" class=p><FONT size=3><FONT face=黑体><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; COLOR: rgb(0,0,0); FONT-WEIGHT: normal; mso-spacerun: 'yes'" class=15>主席团成员五名（其中高一1—2名），经竞选投票产生后，由校团委根据主席团成员工作表现，考察讨论明确具体职务（包括：主席一名，团委副书记一名，副主席两名，主席助理一名）。</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; COLOR: rgb(0,0,0); FONT-WEIGHT: normal; mso-spacerun: 'yes'" class=15><o:p></o:p></SPAN></FONT></FONT></P>
<P style="LINE-HEIGHT: 22pt; MARGIN: 0pt auto; mso-line-height-rule: exactly" class=p><FONT size=3><B><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; COLOR: rgb(0,0,0); FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-spacerun: 'yes'" class=15><FONT face=黑体>三、报名条件</FONT></SPAN></B><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; COLOR: rgb(0,0,0); FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 宋体"><FONT face=宋体>：</FONT></SPAN></FONT><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; COLOR: rgb(0,0,0); FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 宋体"><o:p></o:p></SPAN></P>
<P style="TEXT-INDENT: 24pt; MARGIN: 0pt auto 0pt -0.3pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; mso-para-margin-left: -0.0300gd" class=p><FONT face=宋体><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; COLOR: rgb(17,17,17); FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-bidi-font-family: Tahoma; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 宋体">1.我校高一、高二在读学生；</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; COLOR: rgb(17,17,17); FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-bidi-font-family: Tahoma; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 宋体"><o:p></o:p></SPAN></FONT></P>
<P style="TEXT-INDENT: 24pt; MARGIN: 0pt auto 0pt -0.3pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; mso-para-margin-left: -0.0300gd" class=p><FONT face=宋体><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; COLOR: rgb(17,17,17); FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-bidi-font-family: Tahoma; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 宋体">2.思想进步，政治坚定，品行端正，德育考评等第“良好”以上；</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; COLOR: rgb(17,17,17); FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-bidi-font-family: Tahoma; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 宋体"><o:p></o:p></SPAN></FONT></P>
<P style="TEXT-INDENT: 24pt; MARGIN: 0pt auto 0pt -0.3pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; mso-para-margin-left: -0.0300gd" class=p><FONT face=宋体><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; COLOR: rgb(17,17,17); FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-bidi-font-family: Tahoma; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 宋体">3.团结同学，严于律己，群众基础好；</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; COLOR: rgb(17,17,17); FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-bidi-font-family: Tahoma; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 宋体"><o:p></o:p></SPAN></FONT></P>
<P style="TEXT-INDENT: 24pt; MARGIN: 0pt auto 0pt -0.3pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; mso-para-margin-left: -0.0300gd" class=p><FONT face=宋体><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; COLOR: rgb(17,17,17); FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-bidi-font-family: Tahoma; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 宋体">4.对学生工作富有热情，服务意识强，勤恳敬业；</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; COLOR: rgb(17,17,17); FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-bidi-font-family: Tahoma; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 宋体"><o:p></o:p></SPAN></FONT></P>
<P style="TEXT-INDENT: 24pt; MARGIN: 0pt auto 0pt -0.3pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; mso-para-margin-left: -0.0300gd" class=p><FONT face=宋体><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; COLOR: rgb(17,17,17); FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-bidi-font-family: Tahoma; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 宋体">5.具有较强的组织、表达能力和团队协作的能力；</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; COLOR: rgb(17,17,17); FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-bidi-font-family: Tahoma; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 宋体"><o:p></o:p></SPAN></FONT></P>
<P style="TEXT-INDENT: 24pt; MARGIN: 0pt auto 0pt -0.3pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; mso-para-margin-left: -0.0300gd" class=p><FONT face=宋体><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; COLOR: rgb(17,17,17); FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-bidi-font-family: Tahoma; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 宋体">6.学习成绩较优秀，综合排名不低于班级前20名（重点班不限）。</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; COLOR: rgb(17,17,17); FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-bidi-font-family: Tahoma; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 宋体"><o:p></o:p></SPAN></FONT></P>
<P style="LINE-HEIGHT: 22pt; MARGIN: 0pt auto; mso-line-height-rule: exactly" class=p><B><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-spacerun: 'yes'" class=15><FONT size=3 face=黑体>四、换届流程</FONT></SPAN></B><B><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-spacerun: 'yes'" class=15><o:p></o:p></SPAN></B></P>
<P style="TEXT-ALIGN: left; TEXT-INDENT: 24pt; MARGIN: 0pt; mso-pagination: widow-orphan; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000" class=MsoNormal><FONT face=黑体><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 宋体">团学联主席团换届程序分为自荐申请、初选审查、民主选举、组织考核、正式任命五个阶段。</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 宋体"><o:p></o:p></SPAN></FONT></P>
<P style="TEXT-ALIGN: left; TEXT-INDENT: 21.55pt; MARGIN: 0pt; mso-pagination: widow-orphan; mso-char-indent-count: 1.7900" class=MsoNormal><FONT face=黑体><B><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 宋体">自荐申请</SPAN></B><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 宋体">：符合竞选条件的同学应于规定日期前向校团委提交书面申请。</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 宋体"><o:p></o:p></SPAN></FONT></P>
<P style="TEXT-ALIGN: left; TEXT-INDENT: 21.55pt; MARGIN: 0pt; mso-pagination: widow-orphan; mso-char-indent-count: 1.7900" class=MsoNormal><FONT face=黑体><B><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 宋体">初选审查</SPAN></B><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 宋体">：由校团委组织评审组对报名申请的同学进行审核，确定主席团竞选候选人。</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 宋体"><o:p></o:p></SPAN></FONT></P>
<P style="TEXT-ALIGN: left; TEXT-INDENT: 21.55pt; MARGIN: 0pt; mso-pagination: widow-orphan; mso-char-indent-count: 1.7900" class=MsoNormal><FONT face=黑体><B><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 宋体">民主选举</SPAN></B><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 宋体">：由绍兴一中学生代表大会听取候选人的竞选演说（限时三分钟），并进行民主投票，当场唱票，统计票数，依票数高低确定选举结果。学生代表由各班按班级人数比例的10%推举产生，必须包含班长、团支书。</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 宋体"><o:p></o:p></SPAN></FONT></P>
<P style="TEXT-ALIGN: left; TEXT-INDENT: 21.55pt; MARGIN: 0pt; mso-pagination: widow-orphan; mso-char-indent-count: 1.7900" class=MsoNormal><FONT face=黑体><B><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 宋体">组织考核</SPAN></B><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 宋体">：由校团委对已胜选的候选人进行综合素质考核。</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 宋体"><o:p></o:p></SPAN></FONT></P>
<P style="TEXT-ALIGN: left; TEXT-INDENT: 21.55pt; MARGIN: 0pt; mso-pagination: widow-orphan; mso-char-indent-count: 1.7900" class=MsoNormal><FONT face=黑体><B><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 宋体">正式任命</SPAN></B><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 宋体">：通过校团委考核，并报校党委批准后，任命职务，划分工作职责。</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 宋体"><o:p></o:p></SPAN></FONT></P>
<P style="TEXT-ALIGN: left; LINE-HEIGHT: 22pt; MARGIN: 0pt; mso-pagination: widow-orphan; mso-line-height-rule: exactly" class=MsoNormal><FONT face=黑体><B><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 宋体">五、时间安排</SPAN></B><B><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 宋体"><o:p></o:p></SPAN></B></FONT></P>
