<P style="TEXT-ALIGN: left; LINE-HEIGHT: 22pt; TEXT-INDENT: 24pt; MARGIN: 0pt; mso-pagination: widow-orphan; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000" class=MsoNormal><FONT face=黑体><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 宋体">学生代表大会初步拟定于9月25日中午举行，具体安排另行通知。</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 宋体"><o:p></o:p></SPAN></FONT></P>
