<P style="TEXT-ALIGN: left; TEXT-INDENT: 24pt; MARGIN: 0pt; mso-pagination: widow-orphan; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000" class=MsoNormal><FONT face=黑体><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 宋体">1.参加主席团竞选的同学可同时报名参加各部部长选拔，如未当选主席团成员可参加各部部长的公开选拔。</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 宋体"><o:p></o:p></SPAN></FONT></P>
<P style="TEXT-ALIGN: left; TEXT-INDENT: 24pt; MARGIN: 0pt; mso-pagination: widow-orphan; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000" class=MsoNormal><FONT face=黑体><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 宋体">2.竞选申请内容包括个人简介，</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 宋体">以及对团学联工作的认识、工作思路和打算等。</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 宋体"><o:p></o:p></SPAN></FONT></P>
<P style="TEXT-ALIGN: left; TEXT-INDENT: 24pt; MARGIN: 0pt; mso-pagination: widow-orphan; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000" class=MsoNormal><FONT face=黑体><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 宋体">3</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 宋体">.团学联换届选举工作在公平、公正、公开的原则下进行，杜绝一切徇私舞弊的现象。一经发现候选人有拉选票等情况，立即取消候选人资格，并取消其在校学习期间的团委学生会干部的任用资格。</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 宋体"><o:p></o:p></SPAN></FONT></P>
